# Compiled Executables
*.exe
*.out
/main
# Exception: the UI spawns this at runtime and it ships as an Electron
# extraResource; contributors without Odin still need the app to work.
#
# KNOWN LIABILITY — do not remove this exception on its own. The committed
# binary drifts from the backend source and is not the one CI validates
# (BUGS.md SKB-001, roadmap packet A2). The fix is to untrack it and build on
# `prestart`, but that must land AFTER Odin toolchain resolution (packet A13):
# with no vendored-toolchain lookup and no checked-in binary, the documented
# setup path goes from "preview silently does nothing" to "the app will not
# start". See docs/0.2-ROADMAP.md §4.8.
!skald-ui/skald_codegen.exe

# Agent/assistant working directories
.claude/
fable-prompts/

# Test output
skald-backend/tests/out/

# Build artifacts
*.o
*.obj
*.dll
*.so
*.pdb

# Compiled manual. `scripts/manual/build-manual.mjs` rebuilds skald-manual.html
# (~2 MB) and skald-manual.pdf (~10 MB) from docs/manual-source/, so the build
# output stays out of git for the same reason the codegen binary should: a
# committed artifact drifts from its source silently. Packaging is responsible
# for building it (roadmap packet B6).
/docs/manual/

# Skald-generated scratch output
/skald-ui/generated_audio.odin
/skald-backend/generated_audio.odin
/skald-backend/gen_soft/
/skald-backend/tests/golden/.gen/

# Deliberate local scratch areas
/scratch/
/skald-backend/.scratch/

# Repository-local toolchain and assembled release artifacts
/.tools/
/release/

